      "writtenOn": "2024-10-04T08:53:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we make it more rusty with something like\n\n```\nensure!(matches!(\u0026*self.instance.vm_state.lock().unwrap(), VmState::Running { .. }), \"VM is not running\")\n.or_service_specific_exception(-1)?;\n```\n\nIt\u0027s recommended to use `ensure` or `bail` instead of `Err(anyhow)` [1].\n\n[1] http://docs/document/d/1HyXNRQImaYUVmeq1Z_Ez4vxXlCIQxDKaWo4-BZ75j9Y?tab\u003dt.0#heading\u003dh.bjrh3yw9ntpz",
