      "side": 1,
      "message": "`ensure!(..)` is equivalent to `if !cond return Err(anyhow!(..))`[1]. Sorry, I overlooked the fact that we\u0027re still within the original AIDL method. Typically, when the implementation becomes lengthy, we introduce a more Rust friendly method to avoid repetitive error conversions at the end of each line (See http://b/372472178#comment2). Since we are still in the original method, using `anyhow!(..)` is fine.\n\n[1] https://docs.rs/anyhow/latest/anyhow/macro.ensure.html",
